#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/PaintableBox.cpp (lines 520-992): the scrollbar rectangles and
#       thumb geometry, PaintableBox::paint (backgrounds, borders, collapsed table borders,
#       outlines, scrollbars and the resizer), the middle button scroll indicator and the
#       inspector overlay, the stacking context and z-index, border, backdrop filter,
